{
  "schema_version": "2.0.0",
  "name": "RAN Timing Fault - Governed Remediation",
  "description": "NEP's deterministic RCA verdict arrives by webhook. A task agent explains it to the approver, the switch branches on the verdict, a human approves, and AAP heals PTP timing and verifies the result.",
  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "trigger_webhook",
      "type": "webhook_trigger",
      "name": "RCA Concluded",
      "parameters": {
        "webhook_path": "ran-rca-concluded",
        "input_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "traceId",
            "verdict",
            "faultClass"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "eventId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "traceId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "APPLY",
                "HOLD",
                "NO_ACTION"
              ],
              "description": "Machine verdict from NEP"
            },
            "decision": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "faultClass": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "signal": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "corroboration": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "planes": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "evidence": {
              "type": "array"
            },
            "llmNarrative": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "target": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "cell": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "ptpBridge": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 300
      }
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "verdict_explainer",
      "type": "agentic",
      "name": "Verdict Explainer",
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "You are briefing a human approver for a RAN timing fault. A deterministic RCA engine (NEP) has already decided the verdict. Do NOT re-diagnose and do NOT change the verdict. Explain it in plain language.\n\nRCA result:\n- Verdict: ${trigger.verdict} (${trigger.decision})\n- Fault class: ${trigger.faultClass}\n- Signal: ${trigger.signal}\n- Corroboration: ${trigger.corroboration} real planes agree (${trigger.planes})\n- Target: cell ${trigger.target.cell}\n- NEP narrative: ${trigger.llmNarrative}\n\nIf approved, the automation will do exactly this and nothing else:\n1. Heal the PTP bridge (restore clock lock).\n2. Unlock the O-DU cell (administrativeState=UNLOCKED) and wait for it to be ACTIVE.\n3. Re-run the RCA to verify the fault is gone.\n\nWrite a short brief for the approver. Output ONLY valid JSON:\n{\n  \"what_failed\": \"one or two plain-language sentences\",\n  \"why_hold\": \"why the verdict needs a human (planes agreeing, what is not counted)\",\n  \"if_approved\": \"what the three steps above will do\",\n  \"check_after\": \"what the approver should see when it worked\"\n}",
        "tool_selection_strategy": "NONE",
        "response_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "what_failed": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "why_hold": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "if_approved": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "check_after": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verdict_switch",
      "type": "switch",
      "name": "NEP Verdict",
      "parameters": {
        "cases": [
          {
            "port": "case_0",
            "label": "APPLY",
            "condition": "${trigger.verdict} == 'APPLY'"
          },
          {
            "port": "case_1",
            "label": "HOLD (needs approval)",
            "condition": "${trigger.verdict} == 'HOLD'"
          }
        ],
        "default_port": "default"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 640,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "approval_heal",
      "type": "approval",
      "name": "Approve PTP heal + cell unlock",
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "Approve PTP heal + cell unlock?\n\nWhat failed: ${verdict_explainer.output.what_failed}\nWhy HOLD: ${verdict_explainer.output.why_hold}\nIf approved: ${verdict_explainer.output.if_approved}\nCheck after: ${verdict_explainer.output.check_after}\n\nNEP trace: ${trigger.traceId}"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 980,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record_rejection",
      "type": "aap_job_template",
      "name": "Record rejection / open incident",
      "parameters": {
        "diff_mode": false,
        "job_template_name": "RAN - Record Rejection",
        "organization_name": "Default",
        "extra_vars": {
          "original_trace_id": "${trigger.traceId}",
          "fault_class": "${trigger.faultClass}",
          "signal": "${trigger.signal}"
        }
      },
      "settings": {},
      "position": {
        "x": 1320,
        "y": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "heal_ptp",
      "type": "aap_job_template",
      "name": "RAN - Heal PTP Timing",
      "parameters": {
        "diff_mode": false,
        "job_template_name": "RAN - Heal PTP Timing",
        "organization_name": "Default"
      },
      "settings": {},
      "position": {
        "x": 1320,
        "y": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wait_settle",
      "type": "wait",
      "name": "Wait 10 s",
      "parameters": {
        "duration": 10
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1660,
        "y": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verify_rca",
      "type": "http_request",
      "name": "Verification RCA",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://nep-orchestrator.multivendor-rca.svc:7095/nep/rca/trigger?trigger=ao-verify",
        "body": {}
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1900,
        "y": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verify_check",
      "type": "condition",
      "name": "Fault cleared?",
      "parameters": {
        "condition": "${verify_rca.body.event.verdict} == 'NO_ACTION'"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 2200,
        "y": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "close_rca",
      "type": "aap_job_template",
      "name": "RAN - Close RCA",
      "parameters": {
        "diff_mode": false,
        "job_template_name": "RAN - Close RCA",
        "organization_name": "Default",
        "extra_vars": {
          "original_trace_id": "${trigger.traceId}"
        }
      },
      "settings": {},
      "position": {
        "x": 2500,
        "y": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escalate",
      "type": "aap_job_template",
      "name": "RAN - Escalate",
      "parameters": {
        "diff_mode": false,
        "job_template_name": "RAN - Escalate",
        "organization_name": "Default",
        "extra_vars": {
          "original_trace_id": "${trigger.traceId}",
          "verify_decision": "${verify_rca.body.event.decision}"
        }
      },
      "settings": {},
      "position": {
        "x": 2500,
        "y": 320
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "trigger_webhook",
      "to": "verdict_explainer"
    },
    {
      "from": "verdict_explainer",
      "to": "verdict_switch"
    },
    {
      "from": "verdict_switch",
      "to": "heal_ptp",
      "from_port": "case_0"
    },
    {
      "from": "verdict_switch",
      "to": "approval_heal",
      "from_port": "case_1"
    },
    {
      "from": "approval_heal",
      "to": "heal_ptp",
      "from_port": "approved"
    },
    {
      "from": "approval_heal",
      "to": "record_rejection",
      "from_port": "rejected"
    },
    {
      "from": "heal_ptp",
      "to": "wait_settle"
    },
    {
      "from": "wait_settle",
      "to": "verify_rca"
    },
    {
      "from": "verify_rca",
      "to": "verify_check"
    },
    {
      "from": "verify_check",
      "to": "close_rca",
      "from_port": "true"
    },
    {
      "from": "verify_check",
      "to": "escalate",
      "from_port": "false"
    }
  ]
}